# The Other Side of Truth (Q115), the sculptures: a level 53 character on cond 6 that lost Rafforty's
# letter gets another, gives it to Misa (cond 7), then walks the ice sculptures: the first two move it on,
# the second again is the wrong order, the third gives a piece of the tablet, the fourth asks for the
# watcher; a relog keeps the progress. The watcher's call is the Boot test tests/quest/q115_stranger_test.go.
# Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q115_the_other_side_of_truth_sculptures.golden
character Seeker 53
quest Q115_TheOtherSideOfTruth <cond>=6 <state>=STARTED
